sse pup writes emma  furman was great in the role as cassie  it bothers me how unknown lesser actor  actresses keep getting replaced by  up-and-coming actor actresses  it's almost like they made her role in  end game pointless while thurman was  effectively only in one scene  many fans feel a connection because of  the emotional intensity  of the moment when scott lang returns  from the quantum realm to find he's lost  years of time and that his daughter has  grown up without him in a world ravaged  by thanos  right francisca wait wait the actress  emma fuhrman gave us the best scene of  end game and they recasted her in  ant-man 3  cold people are of course excited about  newton in the role  but it's probably themyscira who said it  best when she wrote  i've been very impressed by catherine  newton and everything i've seen her in  and she does look more like cassie lang  from the comics i do feel bad for emma  furman  kind of sucks to originate her role and  then have it taken from you  there are tons of rumors about the what  where who and how of the mcu's future  but one of the prevailing rumors is that  we're headed towards a young avengers  story one of the members of that team  would just so happen to be a hero named  stature  or as we presently know her cassie lang  in the pages of young avengers  cassie happens to be the pals with  future hawkeye kate bishop  as we know kate bishop is being played  by haley steinfeld  in the upcoming disney plus hawkeye  series so there's a very solid chance  that the mcu will pair the two  characters together  in the future what makes the information  relevant to the casting of cassie lang  is that catherine newton already has a  solid track record as a physical  performer  recently we saw her play a very violent  serial killer in the body swap horror  comedy freaky  however it's also worth noting that she  also played claire novak a hunter on the  long-running cw series supernatural  actors can always train to become action  stars but it's probably not a  coincidence that when marvel recast  cassie lang  they did so with an actor who already  has action star in her dna  ant-man in the wasp quantum mania begins  filming in 2021  and is currently set to release  theatrically in 2022  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite tv shows and movies are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss  single one
 

